 runs as a 2D panel alongside your favorite VR games.\n\n**Features:**\n- Launch and manage dedicated game servers in seconds\n- Track your credit balance and session usage in real time\n- Coordinate with your team \u2014 view rosters, matchups, scrims, and practices\n- Browse and configure games from the full SplatterVault catalog\n- Switch between personal and organization accounts\n- Share active sessions with teammates via invite links\n\n**Built for VR players, by VR players.**\nSplatterVault powers on-demand dedicated servers for competitive and casual VR gaming. This companion app keeps you connected to your servers and team while you play.\n\nRequires a SplatterVault account at splattervault.com.", "short_description": "Manage your SplatterVault game servers directly from Quest. Launch sessions, track credits, coordinate with your team, and monitor matchups \u2014 all without leaving VR."}]}, "developer_name": "VYRX", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://splattervault.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VYRX", "support_website_url": "https://splattervault.com/faq", "website_url": "https://splattervault.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26920859790940686"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/49929